iv>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Filter dates</button>\n      <button type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n    <p id=\"cinema-note-83\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\">Reset returns the calendar to all upcoming screenings.</p>\n  </form>\n</section>"}, "order": ["without", "with"], "blind": "B delivers a polished responsive toolbar grid with 44px touch targets and clean reset-button semantics, whereas A has minimal styling and a Label-in-Name aria-label mismatch on Reset.", "checks": {"without": 2, "with": 2}, "delta": 1}
